  "id": "hoagie-dip",
  "name": "Hoagie Dip",
  "subtitle": "A creamy deli-style dip with cheese, meats, and fresh toppings",
  "description": "Combine a seasoned mayonnaise base with sliced cheese, deli meats, onion, lettuce, and tomatoes, then serve with torn hoagie rolls for dipping.",
